  "changes": {
    "src/control/score.rs": "Reduce GestureScore capacity from 16384 to 64. Each restored recipe has at most 16 gestures.",
    "Cargo.toml": "Omit upstream test-only flate2 dependency; no upstream tests are vendored.",
    "src/voice/human_voice.rs": "Add set_source_live for baseline updates between native control ticks. Preserve held score abduction and unchanged vibrato, and derive effort from current gated pressure. Original set_source and control ordering are unchanged. Vocal split additionally exposes set_voicing_live(amount), used only on the score-free Vocal instance immediately after set_source_live, to blend vibration and glottal opening without resetting physical state."
